1
00:00:07,513 --> 00:00:10,353
Ji Won Ho, you can do an alteration right now, can't you?

2
00:00:10,613 --> 00:00:11,983
An alteration? Here?

3
00:00:12,153 --> 00:00:13,253
What are you talking about?

4
00:00:13,923 --> 00:00:15,793
The finale is going on as planned.

5
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:17,423
How? We don't have a model.

6
00:00:18,723 --> 00:00:19,793
I'm doing it.

7
00:00:20,093 --> 00:00:21,093
What?

8
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:26,833
Ji Won Ho. I'm giving you ten minutes.

9
00:00:48,053 --> 00:00:49,393
Hurry. We're out of time.

10
00:00:50,493 --> 00:00:51,993
All right.

11
00:01:13,143 --> 00:01:14,683
And now for tonight's highlight.

12
00:01:14,683 --> 00:01:16,783
Our finale model makes her entrance.

13
00:02:04,163 --> 00:02:05,263
Brava.

14
00:02:55,453 --> 00:02:56,983
(Episode 4)

15
00:02:57,753 --> 00:02:59,353
- That was a great performance. - You were absolutely radiant.

16
00:02:59,423 --> 00:03:00,423
I really enjoyed the show.

17
00:03:00,483 --> 00:03:02,053
- Thank you for coming. - Truly the best.

18
00:03:02,123 --> 00:03:04,223
- It was so beautiful. - That dress is gorgeous, isn't it?

19
00:03:04,293 --> 00:03:05,523
- Isn't it? Thank you. - Yes.

20
00:03:06,723 --> 00:03:07,863
Please, have some champagne.

21
00:03:08,123 --> 00:03:10,193
- Okay. - You all worked so hard today.

22
00:03:10,263 --> 00:03:12,303
- Have a wonderful time. - Okay.

23
00:03:18,533 --> 00:03:21,743
- He says it was a fantastic finale. - Thank you.

24
00:03:21,903 --> 00:03:23,673
Please tell him it was an honour for me...

25
00:03:23,743 --> 00:03:24,843
to work with Bruni, too.

26
00:03:24,943 --> 00:03:27,983
Thank you. It was an honour for me, too.

27
00:03:28,213 --> 00:03:30,213
Thanks to the collaboration with Bruni.

28
00:03:30,283 --> 00:03:31,813
Thank you so much.

29
00:03:32,783 --> 00:03:35,693
Ma'am, there's someone waiting for you outside.

30
00:03:36,553 --> 00:03:38,993
- Sir, can we get a photo with you? - You were amazing.

31
00:03:39,063 --> 00:03:40,063
Yes, thank you.

32
00:03:40,123 --> 00:03:41,623
Sir, can we please get just one picture?

33
00:03:41,693 --> 00:03:44,493
- Can you do a finger heart for us? - A finger heart?

34
00:03:45,163 --> 00:03:46,533
Thank you for your hard work.

35
00:03:46,603 --> 00:03:48,633
- You'll call us again next time? - Thank you.

36
00:03:48,703 --> 00:03:49,733
- That's right. - Thank you.

37
00:03:49,803 --> 00:03:51,003
- Thank you. - That was amazing.

38
00:03:51,073 --> 00:03:52,543
- Thank you. - You're so cool.

39
00:03:52,603 --> 00:03:53,603
Okay, thank you.

40
00:03:58,613 --> 00:03:59,613
Right this way.

41
00:04:11,493 --> 00:04:13,723
You were amazing on stage today.

42
00:04:14,363 --> 00:04:15,393
Congratulations, Mi Young.

43
00:04:20,763 --> 00:04:23,173
I've always wondered what you'd look like...

44
00:04:24,273 --> 00:04:25,743
in a dress,

45
00:04:26,903 --> 00:04:28,473
and it was just as I imagined.

46
00:04:29,943 --> 00:04:30,943
Really?

47
00:04:32,583 --> 00:04:36,953
The dress I wore at my wedding was much more spectacular.

48
00:04:40,523 --> 00:04:41,753
Now I'm grateful all over again.

49
00:04:43,123 --> 00:04:44,723
For you leaving me back then.

50
00:04:46,093 --> 00:04:48,563
I didn't know back then.

51
00:04:50,363 --> 00:04:51,963
If I had known the truth beforehand,

52
00:04:54,103 --> 00:04:55,803
I never would have let you go like that.

53
00:04:58,403 --> 00:05:00,273
I'm sorry, Mi Young.

54
00:05:03,443 --> 00:05:04,543
Hey, Calvin.

55
00:05:21,463 --> 00:05:23,133
Don't even think about making a move on me like this.

56
00:05:24,393 --> 00:05:27,833
I'm not the Baek Mi Young you once knew.

57
00:05:37,343 --> 00:05:39,143
At this rate, I'll be taking pictures all night.

58
00:05:39,643 --> 00:05:40,843
The corners of my mouth are twitching.

59
00:05:40,913 --> 00:05:42,313
Have you seen the designer, Ji Won Ho?

60
00:05:42,713 --> 00:05:44,483
I know. We have to get a picture with him...

61
00:05:44,553 --> 00:05:46,353
for Instagram. Seriously, where did he go?

62
00:05:46,423 --> 00:05:47,423
I know.

63
00:05:48,793 --> 00:05:50,653
Hey, over there. Isn't that Designer Ji Won Ho?

64
00:05:51,253 --> 00:05:52,923
- Where? - Over there.

65
00:05:53,593 --> 00:05:56,233
- I think that's him. Let's go. - Let's go, come on.

66
00:05:56,593 --> 00:05:57,593
I'm pretty sure that's him.

67
00:05:58,433 --> 00:05:59,403
Sir.

68
00:05:59,463 --> 00:06:00,603
Over here, quick.

69
00:06:02,833 --> 00:06:04,503
- That is Designer Ji Won Ho. - Over here...

70
00:06:05,943 --> 00:06:08,943
- That's weird. He was right here. - He's gone.

71
00:06:09,013 --> 00:06:10,013
No, really...

72
00:06:10,073 --> 00:06:12,413
- I think he went that way. - Hey, over there...

73
00:06:12,483 --> 00:06:13,483
Hey, over there.

74
00:06:23,853 --> 00:06:26,223
I can finally breathe.

75
00:06:26,463 --> 00:06:28,863
I know. It was so stuffy inside.

76
00:06:33,103 --> 00:06:34,103
This is nice.

77
00:06:38,373 --> 00:06:40,203
You didn't come out here because of me, did you?

78
00:06:44,873 --> 00:06:45,913
Well, see you then.

79
00:06:47,243 --> 00:06:48,243
Chicken and beer.

80
00:06:50,483 --> 00:06:51,513
Buy me some.

81
00:06:52,753 --> 00:06:54,253
I said you should buy me some chicken and beer.

82
00:06:55,153 --> 00:06:56,323
You can do that much, right?

83
00:07:07,103 --> 00:07:09,333
Excuse me. Another 500cc beer, please.

84
00:07:09,633 --> 00:07:11,733
Seriously? How much more are you planning to drink?

85
00:07:12,003 --> 00:07:13,873
Why? Are you scared?

86
00:07:14,373 --> 00:07:18,573
- What? - Don't worry. I don't get drunk.

87
00:07:23,183 --> 00:07:24,183
But...

88
00:07:24,853 --> 00:07:26,053
what's the reason?

89
00:07:26,553 --> 00:07:30,623
- The reason? - You were the one who said it.

90
00:07:30,693 --> 00:07:31,723
That I...

91
00:07:33,163 --> 00:07:34,193
That you liked me...

92
00:07:36,663 --> 00:07:38,493
The reason why I like you?

93
00:07:42,773 --> 00:07:44,433
I couldn't forget it.

94
00:07:46,743 --> 00:07:47,803
That warmth.

95
00:07:48,703 --> 00:07:49,773
Warmth?

96
00:07:51,173 --> 00:07:54,143
Eight years ago, what you said back then.

97
00:08:02,253 --> 00:08:04,953
Now that it's come to this, you have no reason to stay here.

98
00:08:07,123 --> 00:08:10,393
So, you want me to go back to Korea alone?

99
00:08:10,763 --> 00:08:11,793
And if you don't?

100
00:08:12,163 --> 00:08:13,863
What will you do? Just stay here and fight with your stepmother?

101
00:08:15,103 --> 00:08:17,503
If you had talent, I would've kept supporting you.

102
00:08:19,003 --> 00:08:21,203
It would've been uncomfortable, but I was going to...

103
00:08:21,273 --> 00:08:23,143
try and have the three of us live together.

104
00:08:25,143 --> 00:08:26,143
Oh.

105
00:08:27,843 --> 00:08:30,453
So I'm nothing to you now, Dad?

106
00:08:31,953 --> 00:08:33,153
Because I have no talent?

107
00:08:34,453 --> 00:08:37,823
Don't feel so wronged. I've done my part as a father.

108
00:08:43,233 --> 00:08:45,293
My stepmother was from Milan,

109
00:08:46,733 --> 00:08:48,263
and she really hated me.

110
00:08:51,273 --> 00:08:54,303
My dad just walked on eggshells around me and my stepmother,

111
00:08:55,403 --> 00:08:57,073
and in the end, he chose my stepmother.

112
00:08:58,313 --> 00:08:59,313
He abandoned me.

113
00:09:12,423 --> 00:09:14,123
Excuse me, I'm just going to use the restroom.

114
00:09:14,193 --> 00:09:15,193
Of course, go ahead.

115
00:09:28,203 --> 00:09:29,613
Where do you think you're going?

116
00:09:42,053 --> 00:09:44,493
Excuse me, you're Korean, right?

117
00:09:48,023 --> 00:09:49,593
It's good to help others,

118
00:09:52,563 --> 00:09:54,703
but you shouldn't lose your own valuables.

119
00:09:55,833 --> 00:09:58,003
This seems much more valuable than my wallet.

120
00:10:05,913 --> 00:10:06,913
Hey...

121
00:10:08,283 --> 00:10:09,483
It all passes.

122
00:10:12,683 --> 00:10:16,153
Stay strong. It'll all pass eventually.

123
00:10:18,553 --> 00:10:19,563
But...

124
00:10:21,093 --> 00:10:22,663
what you said to me back then...

125
00:10:24,133 --> 00:10:25,563
The words, "It all passes."

126
00:10:26,863 --> 00:10:30,033
Those simple words felt so warm.

127
00:10:31,433 --> 00:10:33,873
Because of what you said, I found my courage again.

128
00:10:34,873 --> 00:10:37,043
The courage to do well on my own.

129
00:10:39,443 --> 00:10:41,283
You must have gone through a lot.

130
00:10:42,583 --> 00:10:43,713
I'm okay now.

131
00:10:44,553 --> 00:10:47,283
Just like you said, it really did all pass.

132
00:10:48,583 --> 00:10:50,893
I really just said it without thinking.

133
00:10:51,553 --> 00:10:55,323
Then was the last thing you said also without much thought?

134
00:10:56,293 --> 00:10:58,433
- What did I say? - You said...

135
00:10:59,063 --> 00:11:00,903
that you were grateful I got back your wallet,

136
00:11:01,163 --> 00:11:04,273
and that if we ever met again, you'd be sure to repay me.

137
00:11:05,303 --> 00:11:07,003
I did say that.

138
00:11:07,203 --> 00:11:09,713
I meant it. Of course, I have to repay you.

139
00:11:11,343 --> 00:11:13,313
- Meet me just three times. - What?

140
00:11:13,583 --> 00:11:15,883
From now on, exactly three times, whenever I want.

141
00:11:16,483 --> 00:11:18,053
Let's meet up like this and just talk.

142
00:11:18,813 --> 00:11:20,423
That's how you can repay your debt.

143
00:11:22,493 --> 00:11:23,493
Really?

144
00:11:24,193 --> 00:11:25,423
That's all it would take?

145
00:11:26,963 --> 00:11:27,993
Yes.

146
00:11:29,533 --> 00:11:30,563
Okay.

147
00:11:32,263 --> 00:11:33,263
Cheers.

148
00:11:37,033 --> 00:11:38,603
Don't you think this is fate?

149
00:11:39,673 --> 00:11:42,613
I've prayed during every full moon since then.

150
00:11:43,113 --> 00:11:44,973
I asked to see you again.

151
00:11:46,743 --> 00:11:50,113
And now, here we are.

152
00:11:53,153 --> 00:11:55,283
- What is she talking about? - Excuse me.

153
00:11:55,653 --> 00:11:56,953
Can I get another one over here?

154
00:11:58,523 --> 00:12:00,863
You can order another one when you finish that.

155
00:12:07,163 --> 00:12:08,533
I'm dying here.

156
00:12:10,003 --> 00:12:11,203
But hey...

157
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,073
How much have we had to drink?

158
00:12:16,013 --> 00:12:18,073
Ten 500cc glasses each.

159
00:12:20,283 --> 00:12:22,143
About 10,000cc?

160
00:12:22,513 --> 00:12:23,553
Oh my god.

161
00:12:24,783 --> 00:12:27,583
Are you okay? You're not drunk?

162
00:12:28,323 --> 00:12:30,023
I'm honestly fine.

163
00:12:31,093 --> 00:12:32,923
I told you, I don't get drunk no matter how much I drink.

164
00:12:34,123 --> 00:12:36,193
Gosh, you can really hold your liquor.

165
00:12:36,263 --> 00:12:38,293
Other than my wife,

166
00:12:38,363 --> 00:12:40,233
I've never met anyone who can drink so much.

167
00:12:42,303 --> 00:12:45,133
I guess your wife can really drink too.

168
00:12:45,703 --> 00:12:48,503
She's an amazing drinker. Super tough.

169
00:12:49,173 --> 00:12:52,243
That's one of the things I fell for.

170
00:12:55,213 --> 00:12:56,513
And now,

171
00:12:57,683 --> 00:12:58,813
do you love her?

172
00:13:01,853 --> 00:13:03,423
When you see your wife,

173
00:13:04,123 --> 00:13:05,923
does your heart still flutter?

174
00:13:18,973 --> 00:13:21,303
Flutter? Why would it flutter?

175
00:13:22,713 --> 00:13:23,773
Let's get going.

176
00:13:23,843 --> 00:13:25,043
I can't drink anymore.

177
00:13:25,113 --> 00:13:26,183
Goodness.

178
00:13:51,673 --> 00:13:53,773
(Jihwaja Motel)

179
00:13:53,843 --> 00:13:55,973
Why are you following me?

180
00:13:56,243 --> 00:13:57,743
Because I'm worried.

181
00:13:57,973 --> 00:14:00,413
- What? - On the way here,

182
00:14:00,583 --> 00:14:02,653
do you know you almost fell three times?

183
00:14:03,653 --> 00:14:05,013
Right.

184
00:14:05,883 --> 00:14:08,553
By any chance, do you live here?

185
00:14:09,393 --> 00:14:10,553
(Jihwaja Motel)

186
00:14:12,423 --> 00:14:14,663
This is my place for now.

187
00:14:16,663 --> 00:14:19,963
Anyway, I had fun. Take care.

188
00:14:32,343 --> 00:14:33,513
CEO Ji.

189
00:14:33,583 --> 00:14:34,683
(Jihwaja Motel)

190
00:14:43,423 --> 00:14:44,423
Darn it.

191
00:15:00,343 --> 00:15:01,343
CEO Ji?

192
00:15:03,013 --> 00:15:04,013
CEO Ji.

193
00:15:04,543 --> 00:15:06,383
We switched phones.

194
00:15:23,393 --> 00:15:25,433
Mi Young.

195
00:15:29,263 --> 00:15:30,333
Mi Young.

196
00:15:45,653 --> 00:15:47,153
Hurry. We're out of time.

197
00:15:47,323 --> 00:15:49,053
All right.

198
00:16:22,893 --> 00:16:24,753
(Husband)

199
00:16:24,823 --> 00:16:27,963
Won Ho, you worked hard today.

200
00:16:35,303 --> 00:16:36,603
Thanks for...

201
00:16:40,173 --> 00:16:41,173
Where...

202
00:16:41,973 --> 00:16:42,973
are you?

203
00:16:46,343 --> 00:16:48,883
(Husband)

204
00:16:54,183 --> 00:16:56,953
(Mi Young)

205
00:17:03,293 --> 00:17:05,063
The customer you are trying to reach is unavailable.

206
00:17:05,163 --> 00:17:06,733
Please leave a message after the beep...

207
00:17:30,093 --> 00:17:31,523
I knew it.

208
00:17:32,053 --> 00:17:33,293
What did he take?

209
00:17:41,103 --> 00:17:42,103
Mi Young.

210
00:17:42,733 --> 00:17:44,133
Why did you call at this hour?

211
00:17:44,873 --> 00:17:47,243
How are you, Seung Ho?

212
00:17:47,573 --> 00:17:49,613
Oh, you know me. I'm always doing great.

213
00:17:49,843 --> 00:17:51,313
Are you doing all right, Mi Young?

214
00:17:52,113 --> 00:17:55,913
Yes. The reason I'm calling is,

215
00:17:56,413 --> 00:17:58,113
is Won Ho,

216
00:17:58,753 --> 00:18:00,253
by any chance, at your mother's house?

217
00:18:01,283 --> 00:18:03,923
Won Ho is staying at my motel right now.

218
00:18:05,353 --> 00:18:06,363
The motel?

219
00:18:06,693 --> 00:18:08,793
You know how our mom is, Mi Young.

220
00:18:08,863 --> 00:18:10,563
He can't possibly go home,

221
00:18:10,863 --> 00:18:12,293
so he says he's more comfortable here.

222
00:18:12,933 --> 00:18:13,933
I see.

223
00:18:14,333 --> 00:18:15,333
Mi Young.

224
00:18:15,833 --> 00:18:16,873
Speaking of which,

225
00:18:16,933 --> 00:18:19,373
could you come and drag that brat Won Ho home?

226
00:18:20,143 --> 00:18:21,773
He's a complete mess these days.

227
00:18:23,973 --> 00:18:24,973
Well...

228
00:18:25,043 --> 00:18:27,343
I'm sorry. This is all our fault.

229
00:18:28,043 --> 00:18:30,553
Oh, you have nothing to be sorry for, Mi Young.

230
00:18:32,553 --> 00:18:34,223
Mi Young, I'm sorry, but some customers just arrived.

231
00:18:35,353 --> 00:18:37,693
- For an overnight stay? - No, just for a few hours.

232
00:18:38,093 --> 00:18:39,093
Okay.

233
00:18:59,243 --> 00:19:00,513
When he's sleeping,

234
00:19:01,413 --> 00:19:02,743
he's kind of like a baby.

235
00:19:36,143 --> 00:19:39,723
(Jihwaja Motel)

236
00:19:53,403 --> 00:19:55,633
What a weird dream.

237
00:20:08,213 --> 00:20:09,813
What the?

238
00:20:11,313 --> 00:20:12,453
You're awake?

239
00:20:13,753 --> 00:20:16,283
Hey, what are you doing? Why are you here?

240
00:20:16,593 --> 00:20:17,593
What?

241
00:20:17,653 --> 00:20:20,023
I'm asking why you were sleeping here, Hee Ju.

242
00:20:22,593 --> 00:20:25,393
It looks like we swapped phones yesterday.

243
00:20:25,463 --> 00:20:28,303
I came to switch them back, and then...

244
00:20:28,703 --> 00:20:29,703
And then?

245
00:20:29,773 --> 00:20:32,133
I must've fallen asleep because I was so tired.

246
00:20:33,043 --> 00:20:34,203
No matter how tired you were,

247
00:20:34,273 --> 00:20:35,873
how could you think of sleeping here?

248
00:20:35,943 --> 00:20:38,973
- Are you crazy? - What can I do? I already slept.

249
00:20:39,173 --> 00:20:40,283
Want me to undo it?

250
00:20:42,683 --> 00:20:43,683
Unbelievable.

251
00:20:43,983 --> 00:20:45,013
Jeez.

252
00:20:46,483 --> 00:20:47,483
Jeez.

253
00:20:49,383 --> 00:20:51,153
Won Ho will be so touched.

254
00:20:52,323 --> 00:20:53,893
Is that why you came so early in the morning?

255
00:20:53,963 --> 00:20:55,323
To bring Won Ho a change of clothes?

256
00:20:55,693 --> 00:20:56,863
I noticed...

257
00:20:57,493 --> 00:20:59,563
he didn't pack any of his things.

258
00:21:00,133 --> 00:21:01,733
And I don't know when he'll be back.

259
00:21:02,333 --> 00:21:04,233
Look, instead of all this,

260
00:21:05,003 --> 00:21:06,203
why don't you two just make up now?

261
00:21:07,543 --> 00:21:09,843
- What? - To be honest, Mi Young,

262
00:21:09,913 --> 00:21:11,913
you don't really want a divorce either, right?

263
00:21:12,343 --> 00:21:14,713
If you really couldn't stand Won Ho, why would you bring him clothes?

264
00:21:16,453 --> 00:21:17,513
Just a moment.

265
00:21:17,583 --> 00:21:21,083
(Information)

266
00:21:21,783 --> 00:21:23,453
It's Room 304. Go on up.

267
00:21:23,993 --> 00:21:26,993
- No, it's okay. Could you just... - No way.

268
00:21:27,323 --> 00:21:28,723
Since you're the one who brought them,

269
00:21:28,993 --> 00:21:30,263
you should be the one to give them to him.

270
00:21:30,993 --> 00:21:32,063
Go on.

271
00:21:33,803 --> 00:21:34,803
Go on.

272
00:21:34,863 --> 00:21:37,203
(Jihwaja Motel)

273
00:21:37,273 --> 00:21:38,333
Hurry up.

274
00:21:41,273 --> 00:21:42,273
Okay.

275
00:21:45,673 --> 00:21:46,943
Hee Ju, wait a second.

276
00:21:47,143 --> 00:21:48,843
- Hold on. - Yes?

277
00:21:48,983 --> 00:21:50,513
Are you just going to leave like that?

278
00:21:51,053 --> 00:21:52,213
Well, how else should I leave?

279
00:21:52,553 --> 00:21:54,883
No, what I mean is...

280
00:21:56,723 --> 00:21:58,253
Wait.

281
00:21:59,793 --> 00:22:01,723
About last night...

282
00:22:02,293 --> 00:22:05,033
I didn't make any mistakes, did I?

283
00:22:07,033 --> 00:22:08,663
I'm just...

284
00:22:09,733 --> 00:22:11,103
