290
00:22:28,923 --> 00:22:31,153
Yes, I remember that.

291
00:22:32,193 --> 00:22:33,223
Then we're good.

292
00:22:34,093 --> 00:22:35,923
Hee Ju, wait a second.

293
00:22:43,503 --> 00:22:46,743
I'm sorry. I must have the wrong room.

294
00:22:47,973 --> 00:22:48,973
Hee Ju.

295
00:22:49,043 --> 00:22:50,173
Let's just talk a little more, okay?

296
00:22:50,743 --> 00:22:51,743
Darn it.

297
00:23:04,923 --> 00:23:05,993
(Jihwaja Motel)

298
00:23:07,463 --> 00:23:09,093
Mi Young, are you leaving already?

299
00:23:09,933 --> 00:23:11,033
And she's gone.

300
00:23:12,433 --> 00:23:13,933
Hey, Won Ho.

301
00:23:14,003 --> 00:23:15,103
Mi Young, wait.

302
00:23:15,303 --> 00:23:16,363
Mi Young, wait a minute. Just listen to me.

303
00:23:16,433 --> 00:23:17,573
Just listen for a second.

304
00:23:19,103 --> 00:23:20,443
This is all a complete misunderstanding.

305
00:23:20,673 --> 00:23:22,743
It's absolutely not what you think.

306
00:23:23,343 --> 00:23:26,073
What I think? And what is it that I'm thinking?

307
00:23:26,813 --> 00:23:28,083
No, I mean...

308
00:23:28,883 --> 00:23:29,883
Hee Ju.

309
00:23:30,013 --> 00:23:31,713
Hee Ju, help me out here.

310
00:23:33,983 --> 00:23:35,653
Nothing happened between us last night.

311
00:23:35,723 --> 00:23:36,753
Right?

312
00:23:37,223 --> 00:23:38,223
That's right.

313
00:23:38,293 --> 00:23:40,993
Nothing happened between me and CEO Ji.

314
00:23:42,993 --> 00:23:45,633
CEO Ji and I just had some drinks,

315
00:23:46,363 --> 00:23:48,103
and since we were tired, we slept together, that's all.

316
00:23:48,633 --> 00:23:49,703
Right.

317
00:23:52,733 --> 00:23:55,143
Wait, what do you mean by that? "Slept together?"

318
00:23:55,203 --> 00:23:57,243
Well, we did sleep in the same room.

319
00:24:00,983 --> 00:24:01,983
No.

320
00:24:02,613 --> 00:24:03,813
(Jihwaja Motel)

321
00:24:06,083 --> 00:24:07,083
I see.

322
00:24:07,283 --> 00:24:09,583
Then you two can just keep getting along in one room.

323
00:24:13,293 --> 00:24:14,523
No, Mi Young.

324
00:24:15,423 --> 00:24:17,163
It's not like that.

325
00:24:20,303 --> 00:24:21,463
Darn it.

326
00:24:28,973 --> 00:24:31,143
This is just perfect.

327
00:24:31,943 --> 00:24:33,883
Verbal abuse, profanity, assault, neglect,

328
00:24:33,943 --> 00:24:36,913
