329
00:24:36,983 --> 00:24:39,183
Now you've finally checked all the boxes.

330
00:24:39,923 --> 00:24:42,523
Stop it. I'm not in the mood for jokes.

331
00:24:42,623 --> 00:24:45,123
Jokes? I'm just stating the facts.

332
00:24:45,523 --> 00:24:47,663
