All I did was go to sleep and wake up.

334
00:24:50,533 --> 00:24:52,333
Lawyer, what do I do now?

335
00:24:52,393 --> 00:24:53,363
What do you think?

336
00:24:53,433 --> 00:24:57,733
- Get ready for the nuclear bomb. - A nuclear bomb?

337
00:24:58,673 --> 00:25:00,043
That's why a man must always...

338
00:25:00,103 --> 00:25:02,643
be wary of women and alcohol.

339
00:25:02,703 --> 00:25:03,773
But at the very time...

340
00:25:03,843 --> 00:25:05,743
