342
00:25:08,713 --> 00:25:09,713
Slept with her?

343
00:25:09,783 --> 00:25:11,283
I'm telling you, this is completely unfair.

344
00:25:11,353 --> 00:25:12,913
Strictly speaking,

345
00:25:13,253 --> 00:25:15,883
it was a twin bedroom...

346
00:25:18,123 --> 00:25:20,063
We have to send our response soon,

347
00:25:20,123 --> 00:25:23,763
and you picked the perfect time to get into trouble.

348
00:25:31,033 --> 00:25:32,933
(CEO Baek Mi Young)

349
00:25:46,583 --> 00:25:50,493
I'm sorry. I must have the wrong room.

350
00:25:51,623 --> 00:25:54,493
Hee Ju. Let's just talk a little more, okay?

351
00:25:56,393 --> 00:25:59,363
CEO Ji and I just had some drinks,

352
00:25:59,793 --> 00:26:01,733
and since we were tired, we slept together, that's all.

353
00:26:27,923 --> 00:26:29,493
Mi Young, do you want some cof...

354
00:26:38,303 --> 00:26:39,673
It was like...

355
00:26:39,733 --> 00:26:43,003
the calm before the storm, you know?

356
00:26:43,513 --> 00:26:45,813
No, Mi Young's expression was just like...

357
00:26:45,873 --> 00:26:49,683
Yi Sun Sin right before heading into battle.

358
00:26:49,783 --> 00:26:51,353
Come on, Director Song. How would you know...

359
00:26:51,413 --> 00:26:52,983
what General Yi Sun Sin's expression was?

360
00:26:53,053 --> 00:26:57,123
It was a figure of speech. Oh, honestly.

361
00:26:59,423 --> 00:27:01,123
I wonder what's wrong.

362
00:27:01,793 --> 00:27:05,993
Yesterday's show went well, and everyone was in a good mood.

363
00:27:07,733 --> 00:27:09,163
Do you think she and CEO Ji...

364
00:27:09,263 --> 00:27:11,473
fought again on the way home yesterday?

365
00:27:12,133 --> 00:27:14,403
Whatever's going on between them is their business.

366
00:27:14,603 --> 00:27:16,673
You shouldn't get so involved, Director Song.

367
00:27:16,773 --> 00:27:18,943
When have I ever gotten involved?

368
00:27:19,043 --> 00:27:21,343
Come on. You do it every day.

369
00:27:21,413 --> 00:27:23,683
You're always next to CEO Baek like a little sparrow,

370
00:27:23,753 --> 00:27:25,583
chirping away.

371
00:27:26,853 --> 00:27:28,183
A sparrow?

372
00:27:28,523 --> 00:27:29,623
The nerve.

373
00:27:30,193 --> 00:27:33,253
You want me to really show you how to peck?

374
00:27:33,323 --> 00:27:35,123
I'll show you a sparrow. Chirp, chirp, chirp.

375
00:27:35,123 --> 00:27:37,663
- What are you doing? Hey, stop. - Chirp, chirp, chirp.

376
00:27:37,733 --> 00:27:39,063
What do you think you're doing?

377
00:27:39,363 --> 00:27:40,833
Chirp, chirp, chirp...

378
00:27:51,373 --> 00:27:53,243
Of all the times for her to show up.

379
00:27:55,113 --> 00:27:57,053
She brought me some clothes.

380
00:27:57,553 --> 00:28:00,183
She usually doesn't care what I wear or eat,

381
00:28:00,483 --> 00:28:02,323
but of all days, why did she have to come today? Darn it.

382
00:28:02,383 --> 00:28:04,793
Then why, out of all the days you could have picked,

383
00:28:04,853 --> 00:28:06,593
did you choose to have an affair yesterday?

384
00:28:06,653 --> 00:28:08,993
The day before your wife was set to barge in.

385
00:28:09,063 --> 00:28:10,993
I told you, it wasn't an affair. I swear.

386
00:28:11,063 --> 00:28:13,363
Okay. Then let me correct that with the proper legal term.

387
00:28:13,433 --> 00:28:14,433
Adultery.

388
00:28:14,633 --> 00:28:15,663
Adul...

389
00:28:16,633 --> 00:28:18,433
Seriously... Darn it.

390
00:28:19,473 --> 00:28:20,473
Lawyer, does this mean...

391
00:28:20,543 --> 00:28:22,843
I just have to go along with whatever my wife wants...

392
00:28:23,243 --> 00:28:24,773
and let her divorce me?

393
00:28:24,943 --> 00:28:26,813
Well, we can try to come up with an explanation,

394
00:28:26,883 --> 00:28:29,843
but the fact is, this puts us at a huge disadvantage.

395
00:28:30,083 --> 00:28:33,183
Not unless their side messes up even bigger than we did.

396
00:28:33,853 --> 00:28:36,923
Not a chance. My wife is incredibly meticulous.

397
00:28:36,993 --> 00:28:38,053
Then you'd better be...

398
00:28:38,753 --> 00:28:42,363
on your best behaviour. From this moment on,

399
00:28:42,463 --> 00:28:44,063
don't even think about playing with fire.

400
00:28:44,933 --> 00:28:47,463
Whether you're awake or asleep, watch out for fire.

401
00:28:47,833 --> 00:28:48,933
Watch out for fire.

402
00:28:55,873 --> 00:28:57,143
Kyung Tae.

403
00:28:59,073 --> 00:29:00,073
What?

404
00:29:00,813 --> 00:29:02,243
Who did you say came to the office?

405
00:29:05,553 --> 00:29:08,553
Our hotel is celebrating its 40th anniversary this year.

406
00:29:09,353 --> 00:29:11,053
For our senior clientele,

407
00:29:11,123 --> 00:29:14,093
we're thinking of holding a vow renewal event,

408
00:29:14,863 --> 00:29:17,363
and we'd love for J&White to collaborate with us.

409
00:29:17,993 --> 00:29:20,333
Since it's our 40th anniversary event,

410
00:29:20,433 --> 00:29:24,033
the promotional benefit will be huge for us, and for J&White as well.

411
00:29:24,233 --> 00:29:27,143
The studio, the dresses, the makeup...

412
00:29:27,203 --> 00:29:29,673
All the costs for the entire event...

413
00:29:29,743 --> 00:29:31,143
We'll cover everything.

414
00:29:32,673 --> 00:29:35,813
But why are you so set on doing this with us?

415
00:29:36,683 --> 00:29:37,783
Do I really have to say?

416
00:29:43,653 --> 00:29:46,453
Right. If you work with me,

417
00:29:46,523 --> 00:29:48,193
I'm sure your husband would find it awkward.

418
00:29:50,593 --> 00:29:53,033
So, think about it and let me know.

419
00:29:57,303 --> 00:29:59,103
Nothing happened between us last night.

420
00:29:59,173 --> 00:30:00,543
Right?

421
00:30:00,943 --> 00:30:03,743
CEO Ji and I just had some drinks,

422
00:30:03,813 --> 00:30:05,943
and since we were tired, we slept together, that's all.

423
00:30:09,683 --> 00:30:10,683
All right.

424
00:30:11,913 --> 00:30:13,313
I don't see why not.

425
00:30:15,053 --> 00:30:16,223
On second thought,

426
00:30:16,283 --> 00:30:18,153
I think this is a good opportunity for us too.

427
00:30:18,893 --> 00:30:20,423
Let's do it. The collaboration.

428
00:30:29,633 --> 00:30:30,673
It's important.

429
00:30:36,603 --> 00:30:37,843
That's right.

430
00:30:50,653 --> 00:30:51,893
Hello, CEO Ji.

431
00:30:53,353 --> 00:30:56,823
It's an honour to be working with you again.

432
00:30:56,893 --> 00:30:58,163
Excuse me?

433
00:30:58,693 --> 00:31:00,733
He's just a business partner.

434
00:31:02,963 --> 00:31:05,033
You heard from the vice president, didn't you?

435
00:31:05,303 --> 00:31:07,743
This collaboration with the Calvin Hotel...

436
00:31:07,843 --> 00:31:09,543
is an opportunity we have absolutely...

437
00:31:09,603 --> 00:31:10,643
no reason to turn down.

438
00:31:10,743 --> 00:31:12,113
What do you mean there's no reason to turn it down?

439
00:31:12,173 --> 00:31:13,473
For one thing, I haven't approved it.

440
00:31:13,473 --> 00:31:15,043
Whether it's Calvin or not.

441
00:31:15,113 --> 00:31:18,953
- Should've discussed it with me. - And you.

442
00:31:19,013 --> 00:31:20,323
Did you discuss it with me before you went...

443
00:31:20,383 --> 00:31:21,483
to a motel and slept with that girl?

444
00:31:21,583 --> 00:31:22,583
What?

445
00:31:23,923 --> 00:31:25,323
Hey, I already made myself clear.

446
00:31:25,393 --> 00:31:27,563
I'm telling you, nothing like that happened. Really.

447
00:31:28,763 --> 00:31:30,933
And Hee Ju and I...

448
00:31:30,993 --> 00:31:33,093
We don't have the kind of relationship you think we do.

449
00:31:33,193 --> 00:31:35,633
Not that kind of relationship? Then what is it?

450
00:31:37,373 --> 00:31:38,373
Well...

451
00:31:39,373 --> 00:31:41,473
Someone who provided comfort in moments of struggle?

452
00:31:41,503 --> 00:31:42,903
Goodness me.

453
00:31:42,943 --> 00:31:44,513
What kind of great comfort was she planning on giving you...

454
00:31:44,573 --> 00:31:46,013
