455
00:31:46,073 --> 00:31:48,313
Gosh, you always have to put it like that...

456
00:31:48,383 --> 00:31:50,553
Anyway, about working with Calvin,

457
00:31:50,613 --> 00:31:52,313
discuss it with me again before you decide.

458
00:31:52,613 --> 00:31:53,723
No.

459
00:31:53,883 --> 00:31:56,183
I'm not changing my mind. I'm just going to do it.

460
00:31:56,353 --> 00:31:57,353
What?

461
00:31:57,893 --> 00:32:01,063
As the CEO of this company, I simply made a rational decision.

462
00:32:01,123 --> 00:32:04,193
The employees agreed without any objections. So...

463
00:32:04,263 --> 00:32:06,493
don't even think about ruining this, and just follow my lead.

464
00:32:06,763 --> 00:32:10,373
Who are you telling to follow your lead? Am I your dog?

465
00:32:11,333 --> 00:32:12,473
Oh, right.

466
00:32:12,533 --> 00:32:14,603
You don't have much time left to submit your response.

467
00:32:14,673 --> 00:32:15,843
Don't miss the deadline.

468
00:32:19,843 --> 00:32:21,283
Unbelievable...

469
00:32:23,143 --> 00:32:24,953
It's revenge, that's what it is.

470
00:32:25,583 --> 00:32:26,583
Revenge?

471
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:28,753
"How dare you go in and out of a motel with another woman?"

472
00:32:29,153 --> 00:32:32,093
"Fine, then I'll go ahead and work with my ex-boyfriend."

473
00:32:32,653 --> 00:32:33,763
"As of today,"

474
00:32:33,823 --> 00:32:35,823
"I will walk the path of the office wife."

475
00:32:36,993 --> 00:32:39,463
- Something like that. - What? An office wife?

476
00:32:39,693 --> 00:32:41,263
I'm just kidding.

477
00:32:41,933 --> 00:32:45,173
I really shouldn't have drunk so much yesterday.

478
00:32:45,303 --> 00:32:46,303
But...

479
00:32:46,473 --> 00:32:48,273
are you sure nothing happened?

480
00:32:50,243 --> 00:32:52,443
You said you completely blacked out.

481
00:32:52,773 --> 00:32:54,883
If by some chance something did happen yesterday...

482
00:32:54,943 --> 00:32:57,153
Nothing. Absolutely nothing.

483
00:32:57,513 --> 00:32:58,613
Hey, no matter how drunk I get,

484
00:32:58,683 --> 00:33:00,083
I would never make that kind of mistake.

485
00:33:00,153 --> 00:33:01,423
I may not be perfect, but when it comes to women,

486
00:33:01,483 --> 00:33:02,923
you know I have nothing to hide, don't you?

487
00:33:02,983 --> 00:33:05,493
I know. I know better than anyone...

488
00:33:05,553 --> 00:33:06,893
that you're clean when it comes to women.

489
00:33:06,953 --> 00:33:07,963
Darn it...

490
00:33:08,663 --> 00:33:10,123
Anyway, if Baek Mi Young uses this as an excuse...

491
00:33:10,193 --> 00:33:11,893
